Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:16:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: real zone membership from the server's .map area grids
 (F-219)

WorldMapArea rectangles overlap neighbours: Mulgore's holds the Crossroads, so the druid walked into
level-16 Barrens mobs, died 73 times and spirit-rezzed at the Crossroads. zonemap.area_at() reads
AzerothCore's extracted maps (map_fileheader.areaMapOffset -> AREA grid, GridMap::getArea) and
AreaTable maps area -> zone. A run keeps spawns, givers, enders, objectives and spirit healers in
its zone + capital (city quests count); starting valleys mapped explicitly (Northshire 9 has no
AreaTable row, Valley of Trials 363 points at 6451). leaves_zone now means "spawns nowhere in the
zone" over the whole DB; the level cap uses max(QuestLevel, MinLevel). Mulgore: 48 quests, init 75 s.

